9F89DA4"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 4.png", "id": "533239906175468", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_533239909508801_6084173459485438734_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dv6zQLRLh0wQ7kNvwGDAuMn&_nc_oc=AdrS2VWdyVgTmz9q3XM7HXSXlV_RGaZyGmxVX1Vg_zsgXFvwz1nB2IjlyiRvEQf5laQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1r_oPggHcYGj-C_Q4wWAufZ-XoVArKqhysS1cEVkpjTQ&oe=69F8BEF2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "ThingLink", "keywords": ["immersive", "learning", "interactive", "training", "thinglink"], "long_description": "ThingLink for Meta Quest serves as your immersive learning solution for annotated content and courses created with ThingLink. Engage with a variety of spatial computing experiences, including immersive courses, annotated images/videos, captivating 360-degree media, and interactive 3D models - allowing you to explore objects, mechanisms, and environments in astonishing detail and from every angle.\n\nThingLink for Meta Quest is a proven tool that deepens understanding and positively impacts learning retention through immersion in a variety of multimodal experiences. Whether used for education, upskilling, employee training, or personal growth - ThingLink for Meta Quest makes it easy to explore the world, learn new concepts, and develop new skills in an innovative and engaging way.", "short_description": "ThingLink for Meta Quest is your immersive learning solution for interactive learning content and training courses. Explore annotated images, videos, 360-degree media, and 3D models. Ideal for education and professional development, it enhances understanding and retention through engaging, multimodal experiences, making learning both innovative and impactful."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.thinglink.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.thinglink.com/terms", "publisher_name": "T